# scenario: saving-stalled
# Saving payments that need words: a contested pair, a stalled refill that
# waits, a stalled send a new send replaces, and a lost send. Then a refill
# the device declines ends in an alert, not a toast.
click Saving
expect pending, one of two
expect at most one of them confirms
expect No server holds this refill now
expect Refill again once it is 6 blocks deep.
expect A new send from Saving replaces it
expect New send (replaces this)
expect Your earlier payment of 0.02 BTC
shot history
scroll-end
shot history-end
click Spending
click Refill from Saving
expect Refill Spending
click Confirm on Ledger Nano S+
expect Refill not finished
expect The device rejected the transaction
shot refill-failed
